I follow Priya into the kitchen.
I ask her how I can help.
Priya hands me some plates.
"Let's set the table first," she says.
I take the plates to the dining table.
I think that today's dinner will be very tasty.
I place the plates neatly on the table.
Priya brings the spoons and water glasses.
"Where should I put these glasses?" I ask her.
"Put them on the right side of the plates," she says.
We chat casually while working together.
All this feels very nice and relaxed.
"Will you bring the water jug?" Priya asks.
"Yes, I will bring it right away," I say.
I go back into the kitchen and bring the jug.
Now the table is completely ready.
"Come on, let's sit down for dinner," Priya says with a smile.
